<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures languish with no trades.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures languish with no trades.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interest in Sydney Futures Exchange wheat futures evaporated on Monday with no trades taking place.</p>
<p>Settlement prices showed only minor trendless variations.</p>
<p>One broker described the market as very quiet and lacking in interest.</p>
<p>The March 1997 contract, which expires March 18, looks like going to delivery with few traders closing out their positions, he said.  </p>
